# One turn of the policy loop: the task in, the next chunk of joint targets out. Every policy
# engine serves this and nothing else, which keeps them interchangeable.

# Natural-language task.
string instruction
# First request of a goal. A retry repeats the instruction verbatim, so the engine cannot infer
# the boundary, and a stochastic head only resamples once its history is cleared.
bool new_episode
---
bool ok
# Why no chunk could be produced. Empty when ok.
string message
# Absolute positions for any subset of the arm and hand joints; time_from_start must increase.
trajectory_msgs/JointTrajectory chunk
